        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARPRT19ENTR, Carre Tall Plate Entrance Set with Portofino Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Entry Portofino Lever with Carre Tall Plate shows restraint in style that somehow makes it all the more alluring. This front door lock is a single cylinder function, with a keyed entry on the outside for security. The Carre Tall Plate Entrance Set with Portofino Lever is available in several beautiful and befitting colors including Satin Nickel, Vintage Brass, and Timeless Bronze.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/wave-portofino-lever-with-carre-plate-grandeur-carprt19\"><b>Portofino Lever with Carre Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Grandeur Portofino Lever with Carre Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Portofino Leverset with Carre Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARPRT19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262397\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARPRT19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
